From 106824cafd616f796c848245f1648945b2950c35 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:59:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 244/248] feat(kanban): rows carry kanban_waiting_on ids;
 server._wake_session_turn runs one turn in an unloaded chat [daveey]

Seams for the chat-closeout plugin: a chat that handed its work to cards
shows what it waits on, and gets one close-out turn when they finish even
if no backend holds it (session.resume in-process, like the re-adopted-exit
waker).

Public-series adaptation: preserve merged preceding changes.

---
